{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"C1-07","example":{"issue":{"title":"小型路口，車速與穿越空間是否合適？","intro":"路口空間偏寬，現況停等、穿越與道路使用範圍不夠清楚。","images":[{"key":"results:c1-07-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"crop":[1354.416,933.306,1181.118,1107.275]},{"key":"results:c1-07-diagram-2","label":"現況圖 2","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:c1-07-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:c1-07-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"space","title":"路口寬，車速不易降低","text":"空間使用混亂，車輛通過路口時容易維持較高速度。"},{"id":"pedestrian","title":"行穿線銜接不足","text":"行穿線兩端缺少適當的人行設施銜接。"},{"id":"visibility","title":"停止位置視距不佳","text":"駕駛在停止線處不容易清楚觀察來車。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[113,114]},"assets":{"results:c1-07-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C1-07/C1-07_現況圖_01.png","width":4136,"height":2654,"label":"C1-07 現況圖","scenario":"C1-07","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":113,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image137.png","sha256":"cad3f7df811b6cd6125cf5f164ef545d15b9d60b18a9c054289b0cab689dd8fc"},"results:c1-07-diagram-2":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C1-07/C1-07_現況圖_02.png","width":1341,"height":974,"label":"C1-07 現況圖 2","scenario":"C1-07","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":114,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image138.png","sha256":"499d055952ae9ce737c5a1057310a82495d0dc4997e2afbcf04ec9084355ba36"},"results:c1-07-photo-1":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C1-07/C1-07_現況照片_01.png","width":933,"height":467,"label":"C1-07 現況照片","scenario":"C1-07","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sha256":"5cf0b94587cc07cd92cd94a274da01dd8da082b85c001b4c2620a4173d075830","source":{"file":"C1-07_user-photos.json","sha256":"8bf71e4b605b0955eca29ed6e4a346897d518ccb28eb4f7e6d5d92cc702e692b","type":"user-attachments","receivedDate":"2026-10-31"}},"results:c1-07-photo-2":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C1-07/C1-07_現況照片_02.png","width":933,"height":467,"label":"C1-07 現況照片 2","sc